# Character / avatar

## Ownership

- **`CharacterController`** — motion only (wish, jump, gait phase, `locked`, knockback).
- **`PlayerAvatar`** — root pose + AnimationGroups from `main_man.glb`.
- **`SnowContact`** — footfall brushes only (no continuous pelvis drag).
- **`Bow` / `ArrowPool`** live in `src/combat/` — avatar owns draw busy + aim provider.

Do not revive unwired `figure.js` / `character.js` / cloth unless explicitly requested.

## Locomotion

- Kinematic; no physics engine. Slope traction + coyote/buffer live in the controller.
- Feet stand on heightfield Y with `FOOT_CLEARANCE`; deform is VFX only.
- `locked` (hit/emote/draw/inspect) blocks wish, jump, and gait — same freeze sites.

## Animation

- Clips by name regex: Walk / Run / Alert, `falling_down`, `Stand_Up3`, emotes, `Archery_Shot`.
- `_busy`: `'hit' | 'emote' | 'draw' | null`. While set, `_syncAnim` must not overwrite with locomotion.
- Hit: `falling_down` → `Stand_Up3` → Alert; unlock only after get-up. Not cancellable.
- Draw: **R** (`drawPressed`) plays `Archery_Shot`; look = camera `getLookDir`; pass `getCameraPos` into `bow.releaseShot` so XZ matches the OTS crosshair; release at `RELEASE_T`.
- Emote: **C** cycles `_emotes[]`; cancel on WASD/jump.
- Crossfade with weights OK; **never** `goToFrame` every stride — only on walk↔run swaps.

## New clips

Merge into `main_man.glb` (shared skeleton node indices), crush, then wire by name. Prefer one-shots with `onAnimationGroupEndObservable`.

Fall / get-up / archery / any clip with **Hips XZ root motion** must pin Hips XZ to idle rest (keep Y + rotations). Runtime `_pinHipsXZ` is a safety net; prefer baking the pin into the GLB.

Hand sockets: call `prepareSkeleton()` (`computeAbsoluteTransforms`) before `getHandWorldPos` / bone attach.
